{"title": "Wasting Overflow", "pageid": 30249, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Wasting_Overflow", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Free actions", "Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Wasting Overflow</b> is a variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Overflowing_Brew\" title=\"Overflowing Brew\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Overflowing Brew\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Overflowing_Brew\" title=\"Overflowing Brew\">Overflowing Brew</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\">Thisobald Thorm</a> in Honour mode when his brew type is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Thisobald's unstable brew overflows, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">6d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> to surrounding enemies and empowering his allies with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wasting_Brew_(Condition)\" title=\"Wasting Brew (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wasting Brew\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wasting_Brew_(Condition)\" title=\"Wasting Brew (Condition)\">Wasting Brew</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n  <dt>Damage:</dt>\n<dd> <div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png/27px-D6_Necrotic.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png/40px-D6_Necrotic.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png/54px-D6_Necrotic.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png/27px-D6_Necrotic.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/D6_Necrotic.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">6d6 (6~36)  <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a></span> </div></dd>       <dt> Details: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 5 m (16 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 5 m (16 ft) Radius </dd>\n</dl>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Wasting_Brew\">Condition: Wasting Brew</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wasting_Brew_(Condition)\" title=\"Wasting Brew (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wasting Brew\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wasting_Brew_(Condition)\" title=\"Wasting Brew (Condition)\">Wasting Brew</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage while infused with Thisobald's current brew.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bone_Chilled\">Condition: Bone Chilled</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Chilled_(Condition)\" title=\"Bone Chilled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bone Chilled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Bone_Chilled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Chilled_(Condition)\" title=\"Bone Chilled (Condition)\">Bone Chilled</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can not regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a>.</li>\n<li>Cannot help <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downed</a> characters.</li>\n<li>If Undead, has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\">Thisobald Thorm</a>\n</p><p>This action is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Overflowing_Brew\" title=\"Overflowing Brew\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/40px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/80px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Overflowing Brew\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/40px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Overflowing_Brew\" title=\"Overflowing Brew\">Overflowing Brew</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_Notes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Patch Notes\">Patch #7</a> the damage was increased from 3d6 and the Bone Chilled condition was added.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212723\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37100/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9982/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 30/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 853557/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.081      1 -total\n 99.43%   63.717      1 Template:Action_Page\n 35.80%   22.939     35 Template:Trim\n 35.51%   22.757      9 Template:Icon_text\n 34.31%   21.983      8 Template:Icon_link\n 28.94%   18.545      1 Template:PageSeo\n 28.45%   18.234      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.16%   16.762      2 Template:Condition\n 16.54%   10.600      9 Template:Ifempty\n 15.61%   10.000      1 Template:SAI\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30249-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714212723 and revision id 226460. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}